  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Lengthening</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A buildable tubing mascara that lifts, separates, and sculpts lashes for precise, all-day volume.<b><br><br>Formulation Type: </b>Volumizing and Lengthening<br><br><b>Benefits: </b>Long-wearing<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> Finally, a volumizing mascara that actually lifts. Designed with a petite precision brush, it works with MERIT’s lightweight, Japanese-made tubing formula to build clump-free volume, length, and lift that’s precise—never heavy or overdone. Safe for sensitive eyes; removes with warm water.<br><br><b>Clean at Sephora<br></b>Clean at Sephora is our commitment to offering effective products without certain ingredients, such as parabens, sulfates, phthalates, and mineral oils.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Comb through lashes from root to tip. Build up for more impact.<br>-To remove, wash with warm water and cleanser.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Water (Aqua/Eau), Ammonium Styrene/Acrylates Copolymer, Butylene Glycol, Copernicia Cerifera (Carnauba) Wax (Copernicia Cerifera Cera/Cire De Carnauba), Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Stearic Acid, Glyceryl Stearate, Pentylene Glycol, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, Cetearyl Alcohol, PVP, Aminomethyl Propanol, Glycerin, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Bran Wax, Acrylates/Va Copolymer, Xanthan Gum, Polyglyceryl-10 Myristate, Alcohol, Myrothamnus Flabellifolia Leaf/Stem Extract, Isochrysis Galbana Extract; May Contain/Peut Contenir (+/-): CI 77491/CI 77492/CI 77499 (Iron Oxides).<br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Lengthening</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A buildable tubing mascara that lifts, separates, and sculpts lashes for precise, all-day volume.<b><br><br>Formulation Type: </b>Volumizing and Lengthening<br><br><b>Benefits: </b>Long-wearing<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> Finally, a volumizing mascara that actually lifts. Designed with a petite precision brush, it works with MERIT’s lightweight, Japanese-made tubing formula to build clump-free volume, length, and lift that’s precise—never heavy or overdone. Safe for sensitive eyes; removes with warm water.<br><br><b>Clean at Sephora<br></b>Clean at Sephora is our commitment to offering effective products without certain ingredients, such as parabens, sulfates, phthalates, and mineral oils.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Comb through lashes from root to tip. Build up for more impact.<br>-To remove, wash with warm water and cleanser.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Water (Aqua/Eau), Ammonium Styrene/Acrylates Copolymer, Butylene Glycol, Copernicia Cerifera (Carnauba) Wax (Copernicia Cerifera Cera/Cire De Carnauba), Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Stearic Acid, Glyceryl Stearate, Pentylene Glycol, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, Cetearyl Alcohol, PVP, Aminomethyl Propanol, Glycerin, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Bran Wax, Acrylates/Va Copolymer, Xanthan Gum, Polyglyceryl-10 Myristate, Alcohol, Myrothamnus Flabellifolia Leaf/Stem Extract, Isochrysis Galbana Extract; May Contain/Peut Contenir (+/-): CI 77491/CI 77492/CI 77499 (Iron Oxides).<br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
